#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1225
#: src/AgentX/chat/ResolveChanges.jsx:20
msgid "Couldn't find the block as it was before this edit."
msgstr "Non è stato possibile ritrovare il blocco com’era prima di questa modifica."

#. translators: Reason shown under the name of one of the user's unsaved edits that the AI Agent couldn't apply again: after the page changed elsewhere, several blocks match the one that edit changed, so the agent can't tell which.
#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1228
#: src/AgentX/chat/ResolveChanges.jsx:26
msgid "More than one block now looks like the one this edit changed."
msgstr "Più di un blocco ora somiglia a quello che questa modifica aveva cambiato."

#. translators: Reason shown under the name of one of the user's unsaved edits that the AI Agent couldn't apply again: It means that named edit, and builds on means it was made on top of an earlier edit that also failed.
#: public/build/extendify-agentx-5123061faaccc9af69d5.js:1231
#: src/AgentX/chat/ResolveChanges.jsx:32
msgid "It builds on an edit that couldn't be applied."
msgstr "Si appoggia a una modifica che non è stato possibile applicare."

